    <div class="ed-accent-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <h2 class="ed-section-label">Workflows</h2>
    <p class="headline">From a single command to agent orchestration skills.</p>
    <div class="modes">
      <article>
        <h3>Solo</h3>
        <p class="command">
          workmux add -A "Add cursor-based pagination to /api/users"
        </p>
        <p>
          One command creates a branch, worktree, and starts an agent with your
          prompt in a new tab.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Delegated</h3>
        <p class="command">
          <code>/worktree</code> Implement the caching layer
        </p>
        <p>
          From inside an agent, spin off a subtask to a new worktree with full
          context.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Coordinated</h3>
        <p class="command">
          <code>/coordinator</code> Break down the auth refactor into parallel tasks
        </p>
        <p>One agent spawns, monitors, and merges multiple worktree agents.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <a href="/guide/workflows/" class="ed-text-link">Learn more →</a>
  </div>
</section>

